{
  "description": "合流：会话开始时注入「你在哪个分支、对应哪张功能卡、预约哪一版、落后多少」；会话每轮结束时把最后活动记进本机缓存。不注册 WorktreeCreate（该事件会替换 Claude Code 默认的 worktree 创建，heliu 不代建 worktree）。",
  "hooks": {
    "SessionStart": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bun",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/heliu-hook"],
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "Stop": [
      {
        "hooks": [
          {
            "type": "command",
            "command": "bun",
            "args": ["${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}/bin/heliu-hook"],
            "timeout": 5
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
